        "t": 684.79,
        "r": 537.13,
        "b": 661.2
      },
      "content": "CAUTION: The door is still attached to the printer by the left-side retainer arm. Do not attempt to completely remove the door.",
      "severity": "caution"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1349",
      "reading_order": 1736,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 651.79,
        "r": 529.1000000000001,
        "b": 628.2
      },
      "content": "Reinstallation tip: When reinstalling the door, there are two right-side hinge pins (not shown in callout 3)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1350",
      "reading_order": 1737,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 618.79,
        "r": 522.3800000000001,
        "b": 607.2
      },
      "content": "Keep a finger pressed on the left-side retainer arm so that it does not disengage from the door."
    },
